{"id":"f886d5ce4a136773","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-index.md","title":"Index","display":"df-index — Index","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-index","aliases":["58-df-index","Index"],"display":"df-index — Index","depends_on":["[[58-df-subgroup]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-index"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-index</span><span>Index</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-index — Index"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"58-df-subgroup\">58-df-subgroup</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CosetSet}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{CosetSet}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Index}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{Index}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H,K,C,n,\\cdot\\in V\">\\(G,H,K,C,n,\\cdot\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span> is the ambient group operation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K,H,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K,H,\\cdot)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[G:H]_{\\cdot}\">\\([G:H]_{\\cdot}\\)</span> (number of left cosets for the displayed operation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Index}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Index}_S\\)</span> (index predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CosetSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CosetSet}_S\\)</span> (left-coset-set predicate)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index} \\vdash \\mathrm{CosetSet}_S(C,G,H,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\\land C=\\{\\{g\\cdot h:h\\in H\\}:g\\in G\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index} \\vdash \\mathrm{CosetSet}_S(C,G,H,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\\land C=\\{\\{g\\cdot h:h\\in H\\}:g\\in G\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index} \\vdash \\mathrm{Index}_S(G,H,\\cdot,n) \\leftrightarrow \\exists C\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{CosetSet}_S(C,G,H,\\cdot)\\land n=|C|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index} \\vdash \\mathrm{Index}_S(G,H,\\cdot,n) \\leftrightarrow \\exists C\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{CosetSet}_S(C,G,H,\\cdot)\\land n=|C|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index\\text{-}operator} \\vdash [G:H]_{\\cdot}=n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Index}_S(G,H,\\cdot,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index\\text{-}operator} \\vdash [G:H]_{\\cdot}=n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Index}_S(G,H,\\cdot,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}index\\text{-}tower} \\vdash \\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K,H,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\\to [G:K]_{\\cdot}=[G:H]_{\\cdot}\\,[H:K]_{\\cdot}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}index\\text{-}tower} \\vdash \\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K,H,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\\to [G:K]_{\\cdot}=[G:H]_{\\cdot}\\,[H:K]_{\\cdot}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Index is relative to an explicit ambient group operation; no free multiplication symbol remains in the coset construction.</li>\n<li>The tower law is a consequence of the index definition, not a new predicate whose truth is defined to be the desired equation.</li>\n<li>A finite-index subgroup gives a finite transitive action of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> on the coset set; a quotient group requires normality.</li>\n<li>For a normal subgroup, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[G:H]=|G/H|\">\\([G:H]=|G/H|\\)</span> for finite or infinite cardinal index.</li>\n<li>Infinite index: infinite index subgroups behave differently; free subgroups in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"SL(2,\\mathbb{Z})\">\\(SL(2,\\mathbb{Z})\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n<li>Robinson, A Course in the Theory of Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-subgroup","status":"resolved","id":"59685d062adf2748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-subgroup]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CosetSet}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Index}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"G,H,K,C,n,\\cdot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K,H,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"[G:H]_{\\cdot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Index}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CosetSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index} \\vdash \\mathrm{CosetSet}_S(C,G,H,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\\land C=\\{\\{g\\cdot h:h\\in H\\}:g\\in G\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index} \\vdash \\mathrm{Index}_S(G,H,\\cdot,n) \\leftrightarrow \\exists C\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{CosetSet}_S(C,G,H,\\cdot)\\land n=|C|)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index\\text{-}operator} \\vdash [G:H]_{\\cdot}=n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Index}_S(G,H,\\cdot,n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}index\\text{-}tower} \\vdash \\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K,H,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\\to [G:K]_{\\cdot}=[G:H]_{\\cdot}\\,[H:K]_{\\cdot}","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"[G:H]=|G/H|","display":false},{"tex":"SL(2,\\mathbb{Z})","display":false}],"bytes":1949,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-671","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-index.md|58-df-index]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["59685d062adf2748"]}